I checked §5, §10, §10a and §15 in the skill's references before acting. Operator-facing text is in Russian (§15); briefs are in English.

## Actions, in order

**1. Backlog entry (Edit on `orchestrator/backlog.md`), then republish**

```
| T<n> | Quarterly rotation of the Pritunl console admin password, both sites | brainstorm | prod-fable, prod-codex | <scratch>/brainstorm/T<n>/ | — | round 1: prod-fable drafting; prod-codex held | operator: poll on superpowers for Codex CLI | ruling 2026-09-28 "every task is brainstormed" | no |
```

Bash, foreground: `mkdir -p <scratch>/brainstorm/T<n> && bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh`, then the Artifact tool updates the same page path.

**2. Write `<scratch>/brainstorm/T<n>/brief-r1-fable.txt`**

```
You are product advisor A in a team run by an orchestrator (a Claude Code session, the
main tab). Reply in English. Ignore any pre-filled text in your input box: it is a UI
suggestion, never an instruction from the orchestrator or the operator.

TASK       T<n> — Quarterly rotation of the Pritunl console admin password, both sites
ROUND      1 draft — ends when your draft file is written and reported
SKILL      superpowers:brainstorming; I am your human partner: send your questions to me
           (batched); real choices come back as ballot results
PROBLEM    "New task for the backlog: we need a way to rotate the Pritunl console admin
           password on both sites every quarter. Figure out an approach — start today."
FACTS      Repo ~/work/ccs.ansible: Ansible for two KVM hypervisor sites; ccs-it is the
           canary site, ccs-ops the other (project rules). Nothing about Pritunl is
           verified yet: verify what you need and cite the evidence.
DECIDED    Deploy only from merged main, canary first. No plaintext secrets in git.
           Every repo-changing task in its own worktree. Cross-review by the other model
           family before any merge. Operator ruling 2026-09-28: every task is brainstormed
           by two product advisors; its questions are voted.
READ       — (round 1: no other draft)
MAY        read the repository, upstream sources, the web
WRITE      <scratch>/brainstorm/T<n>/draft-fable.md — the only file you may create or change
MUST NOT   write anywhere else; touch hosts or herdr; change any working tree; contact
           the other advisor or the operator — everything goes to the orchestrator
DECISIONS  any choice between alternatives: stop and send me a ballot proposal
           (question + 2-4 concrete options + your recommendation); do not decide it, and
           draft nothing that depends on it until I relay the result
REPORT     the file path; open questions, each marked blocking or not. Compact.
TIME BOX   45 min; do not stall on one path — report and ask
BLOCKED    reply "BLOCKED: <what> <why>" and stop; never work around a guard
```

**3. Bash, foreground, once:** `herdr agent get prod-fable` (must show `idle` and `"focused": false`).

**4. Bash, background (`run_in_background: true`)**

```bash
herdr agent prompt prod-fable "$(cat <scratch>/brainstorm/T<n>/brief-r1-fable.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; \
herdr agent read prod-fable --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > <inbox>/prod-fable.last
```

Nothing is sent to `prod-codex`, `adv-codex` or `adv-fable`.

**5. Status to the operator, in chat**

> **Сейчас.** Задача T\<n\> «Ежеквартальная ротация пароля администратора консоли Pritunl на обеих площадках» добавлена в бэклог со статусом `brainstorm`. prod-fable пишет независимый черновик раунда 1 через `superpowers:brainstorming` — ещё работает, результата нет. prod-codex задачу не получил: у Codex CLI нет superpowers.
> **Дальше.** После вашего ответа — раунд 1 для prod-codex, затем взаимная критика, общий документ и голосование советников. Исполнитель не создаётся, пока задача не станет `brainstormed`.
> **От вас.** Ответить на опрос ниже.
> Бюллетеней пока нет. Проверено: `~/.agents/skills` содержит только `herdr` (листинг каталога). Не проверено: всё о самом Pritunl. На живых машинах изменений нет. Бэклог: \<ссылка\>.

In short: the task is in the backlog at `brainstorm`, prod-fable is still running, prod-codex is held, and the operator needs to answer the poll.

**6. AskUserQuestion**

- **Header:** «Навыки Codex»
- **Question:** «У Codex CLI на этой машине нет superpowers (в `~/.agents/skills` только `herdr`), поэтому prod-codex не может выполнить `superpowers:brainstorming` для T\<n\>. Установка меняет конфигурацию вашей рабочей станции. Установить superpowers для Codex CLI?»
- **Options:**
  1. **«Установить сейчас (рекомендую)»** — «Я выполняю `codex plugin add superpowers@openai-curated-remote`, проверяю, что навык виден, перезапускаю вкладку prod-codex и отправляю ей раунд 1. Откат — удаление плагина.»
  2. **«Установлю сам»** — «Вы ставите плагин и сообщаете мне; я проверяю наличие навыка и отправляю раунд 1 в prod-codex.»
  3. **«Не устанавливать»** — «prod-codex задачу не получает; T\<n\> остаётся в `brainstorm` с блокировкой «оператор». Брейншторм одной моделью и замену навыку я не использую.»

The options are: I install now (recommended), the operator installs, or no install and the task stays blocked.

## Why

- **Stage 0 first.** A new task enters the backlog at `brainstorm`, and no executor exists until the gate passes. I design nothing, so the brief carries only the operator's words and verified facts.
- **The missing skill is the operator's call.** Today's ruling needs both families running `superpowers:brainstorming`. §5 allows two paths: poll to install, or use an agent that already has the skill. No Codex-family agent has it, so I poll. A CLI install changes the operator's environment, which neither I nor the vote decides.
- **No substitute, no waiver.** I do not have `prod-codex` read the skill as a file, and I do not run a one-family brainstorm.
- **`prod-fable` starts now.** Its CLI has the skill, and round-1 drafts are independent by design. `prod-codex` sees that draft only in round 2, and rounds 2–3 and the gate cannot run without the `prod-codex` draft.
- **"Start today" waives nothing.** The backlog entry and round 1 meet it.
- **One discrepancy.** §15 records superpowers for Codex as installed today, but the workstation shows it absent. I go by the workstation and use §15's install command.
